From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:02:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/31] Lapin UX: retest round: + stays, tighter rows, pages in
 the details pane, double-click on Home and This PC

Refs #143, #149. Tabs are sized to the room beside + and the window
buttons, so + never drops off. Details rows are always 24 px (Compact view
is gone). History, Options, About and Add network drive open in the details
pane with a title and a close button, and the pane goes back to the details
when a file or folder is clicked or the place changes. On Home and This PC a
click picks an item and a double-click opens it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016CkhomYUp7uVySJk724Amq
